    },
    {
      "id": "HNO4-GS4iaBGSNI0DZkBe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1750.5416666666665,
      "y": 5156.041666666668,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "y0hfOdMtzcOzNXwdAulnE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bN2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1325486955,
      "version": 405,
      "versionNonce": 1287558621,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783914709212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "既然现在用的是开发板和面包板\n那么我买的焊接的东西是用在假期后\n半部分了？\n现在我能拿他的作用就是练手防止以\n后出问题",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "EpvByola6WdQEz0RRd0EO",
      "originalText": "既然现在用的是开发板和面包板\n那么我买的焊接的东西是用在假期后半部分了？\n现在我能拿他的作用就是练手防止以后出问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "AjcYe4DqoBre6KWrbGjdl",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 884.9166666666665,
