    },
    {
      "id": "B2QTgHFu_-5HDWOU0PfPo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 898.0416666666665,
      "y": 5103.541666666668,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "y0hfOdMtzcOzNXwdAulnE"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bN4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 914277285,
      "version": 402,
      "versionNonce": 309232285,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783914709212,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这样子相比较而言\n面包板的试错成本低，错了可以及时更改\n利用的地方就是熟悉电路是否正常搭建，\n为以后提供基础\n电路板就是接上放下都需要焊接，不仅麻\n烦，还有可能失误等等原因导致某些问题",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "AjcYe4DqoBre6KWrbGjdl",
      "originalText": "这样子相比较而言\n面包板的试错成本低，错了可以及时更改\n利用的地方就是熟悉电路是否正常搭建，为以后提供基础\n电路板就是接上放下都需要焊接，不仅麻烦，还有可能失误等等原因导致某些问题",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
